1
00:00:01,240 --> 00:00:03,200
You might win an extra item!

2
00:00:03,980 --> 00:00:08,340
I am strongly considering holding
a Dungeon Goddess Grand Prix.

3
00:00:08,660 --> 00:00:10,248
Fine, but you're too close!

4
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:12,530
What the?

5
00:00:12,613 --> 00:00:13,443
Back off there, Munami!

6
00:00:13,526 --> 00:00:14,536
Sorry, sorry, sorry.

7
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:16,140
So hear me out.

8
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:19,477
With all the new refugees in the
village, the populations exploded.

9
00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:22,397
I thought we should do something to
build strong relationships with them.

10
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:23,457
And then it hit me!

11
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:26,397
Why don't we hold a huge festival
and invite the entire town?

12
00:00:26,480 --> 00:00:28,200
That led me to another idea.

13
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:30,917
I call it the Dungeon Goddess Grand Prix.

14
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:32,118
That's a good idea.

15
00:00:32,440 --> 00:00:34,557
The eating contest we
held was a big success,

16
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:37,577
and this will serve as a
diversion, a much needed one.

17
00:00:37,660 --> 00:00:39,740
Might be eat, not ice. Yeah, right?

18
00:00:39,960 --> 00:00:42,901
I am going to need your
help to pull it off, Boxo.

19
00:00:43,180 --> 00:00:45,440
I'll pay you one, no, two gold coins.

20
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:47,997
You see, I was thinking
that for the grand prize,

21
00:00:48,080 --> 00:00:50,597
we could reward the champion with
50 of their favorite products?

22
00:00:50,680 --> 00:00:52,092
from you free of charge.

23
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:53,037
What do you think?

24
00:00:53,120 --> 00:00:55,297
At that point, I'd still
finish way up in the black.

25
00:00:55,380 --> 00:00:57,027
There's no reason to refuse.

26
00:00:57,560 --> 00:00:58,390
Hello there.

27
00:00:58,720 --> 00:01:00,400
Thank you so much, Boxo.

28
00:01:00,540 --> 00:01:01,716
You're the real MVP.

29
00:01:01,940 --> 00:01:03,764
The Dungeon Goddess Grand Prix?

30
00:01:05,020 --> 00:01:06,777
Shirley will be a top contender.

31
00:01:06,860 --> 00:01:08,036
Oh, she surely will.

32
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:11,337
She has the looks, and she's used
to getting public attention, too.

33
00:01:11,420 --> 00:01:12,680
What about you?

34
00:01:13,260 --> 00:01:15,357
You're talking like you won't compete.

35
00:01:15,440 --> 00:01:17,499
But you will if I have a say in it.

36
00:01:18,880 --> 00:01:20,720
There is no way I'm competing.

37
00:01:20,900 --> 00:01:22,117
I don't want to either.

38
00:01:22,200 --> 00:01:23,497
I'm way too shy. Oh.

39
00:01:23,580 --> 00:01:27,117
What if I threw in a week's worth
of free meals to sweeten the deal?

40
00:01:27,200 --> 00:01:28,500
That does sound nice.

41
00:01:28,820 --> 00:01:31,055
Well, I'm a no no matter what you say.

42
00:01:31,680 --> 00:01:34,357
Aw, don't you wanna see what
these girls can do, Boxo?

43
00:01:34,440 --> 00:01:35,270
What?

44
00:01:35,353 --> 00:01:36,677
Now you're putting this on me?

45
00:01:36,760 --> 00:01:37,977
That's not cool, man.

46
00:01:38,060 --> 00:01:39,517
What's the right way to respond?

47
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:40,917
Should I say yes or no?

48
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:43,597
Seems like the kind of situation
where I'm screwed either way.

49
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:44,739
Think, man, think.

50
00:01:45,140 --> 00:01:45,970
Too bad.

51
00:01:46,240 --> 00:01:49,181
There, that's vague enough
to be taken either way.

52
00:01:49,460 --> 00:01:50,290
Too bad?

53
00:01:50,373 --> 00:01:51,437
Does that mean yes or no?

54
00:01:51,520 --> 00:01:53,640
Yeah, be more specific, Boxo.

55
00:01:53,980 --> 00:01:54,860
But how?

56
00:01:55,940 --> 00:01:58,411
Fine, guess it's not good to be too pushy.

57
00:01:58,540 --> 00:02:00,080
But consider this, girls.

58
00:02:00,360 --> 00:02:03,125
If Shirley wins, she'll
get 50 items from Boxo.

59
00:02:03,340 --> 00:02:05,500
I'm so overcome with emotion.

60
00:02:05,780 --> 00:02:08,057
I might just grab Boxo
and give him a passionate

61
00:02:08,140 --> 00:02:10,611
kiss right on the glass of his front side.

62
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:13,260
Or so she was saying.

63
00:02:13,460 --> 00:02:15,320
But you two are not in. Got it.

64
00:02:16,740 --> 00:02:17,570
Yes?

65
00:02:17,653 --> 00:02:19,420
What is it, my dear sweet llamas?

66
00:02:20,160 --> 00:02:20,990
I...

67
00:02:21,073 --> 00:02:24,940
I guess I will enter the Dungeon
Goddess Grand Prix after all!

68
00:02:25,120 --> 00:02:27,340
Oh, so Lamas has decided to enter.

69
00:02:27,680 --> 00:02:30,157
You are really popular
around here, you know,

70
00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:32,417
so that could make you a top contender.

71
00:02:32,500 --> 00:02:34,020
Munami's enjoying this.

72
00:02:34,200 --> 00:02:35,553
What about you, Hulemy?

73
00:02:35,820 --> 00:02:38,117
Not that you have to feel
pressured or anything.

74
00:02:38,200 --> 00:02:39,420
Uh, well, I...

75
00:02:40,860 --> 00:02:41,690
Evil.

76
00:02:41,773 --> 00:02:44,320
Ugh, fine, I'll enter, I guess. Huh?

77
00:02:47,020 --> 00:02:47,850
Really?

78
00:02:48,180 --> 00:02:52,533
Well, yes, because lately I've been
developing a magic item of attraction.

79
00:02:52,820 --> 00:02:54,677
Entering could be useful for that process.

80
00:02:54,760 --> 00:02:56,642
You know, for research purposes.

81
00:02:56,800 --> 00:02:59,565
So then the both of you
are participating, huh?

82
00:03:00,360 --> 00:03:02,595
Things have taken an interesting turn.

83
00:03:03,080 --> 00:03:03,910
Yeesh.

84
00:03:03,993 --> 00:03:06,577
Who's this sleazebag and what
has she done with Moon Ami?

85
00:03:06,660 --> 00:03:09,237
I bet that bit about
Shirley was a lie, too.

86
00:03:09,320 --> 00:03:13,026
But hey, if they're both entering,
they've got my full support.

87
00:03:20,460 --> 00:03:22,657
On the outside, I'm just a big metal box.

88
00:03:22,740 --> 00:03:24,877
But inside, I've still got a human soul.

89
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:27,497
In this new world of
wonders, I travel to and fro!

90
00:03:27,580 --> 00:03:29,697
On the back of my super
strong partner, Lamas.

91
00:03:29,780 --> 00:03:31,157
The name's Boxo.

92
00:03:31,240 --> 00:03:32,177
Hello there?

93
00:03:32,260 --> 00:03:34,160
That means yes, by the way.

94
00:03:47,860 --> 00:03:49,640
Thank you.

95
00:04:48,860 --> 00:04:49,820
Form change!

96
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:54,840
Oh, I love a festival.

97
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:56,737
There's been so much fighting lately.

98
00:04:56,820 --> 00:04:58,879
This will be a nice change of pace.

99
00:04:59,040 --> 00:05:00,357
I'll be there for sure.

100
00:05:00,440 --> 00:05:02,087
Yeah, looking forward to it.

101
00:05:02,360 --> 00:05:04,536
Says here it takes place in one week.

102
00:05:04,660 --> 00:05:06,440
This looks like oodles of fun.

103
00:05:06,640 --> 00:05:08,287
And rebuilding's going well.

104
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:13,245
Therefore, I feel it's only right that my
company should contribute to the cause.

105
00:05:15,040 --> 00:05:17,617
I'm planning on taking
part in the Grand Prix.

106
00:05:17,700 --> 00:05:20,217
Festivals like this really
are always so much fun.

107
00:05:20,300 --> 00:05:23,771
And I want to contribute to do
the Clear Flow Locals proud.

108
00:05:24,340 --> 00:05:27,240
Whoa, she won't be easy
to beat by any stretch.

109
00:05:27,620 --> 00:05:30,217
Although I'd like to give my
two the upper hand somehow.

110
00:05:30,300 --> 00:05:33,237
Do I have some product that
could help them win this thing?

111
00:05:33,320 --> 00:05:36,957
Welcome to the How to Win the Dungeon
Goddess Grand Prix emergency meeting.

112
00:05:37,040 --> 00:05:37,957
Thanks for coming.

113
00:05:38,040 --> 00:05:38,870
Let's do this.

114
00:05:40,040 --> 00:05:43,157
I'm gonna get that Voxo gift
certificate no matter what.

115
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:44,577
Let's bake this, cookie girls.

116
00:05:44,660 --> 00:05:47,425
It seems there will be
quite a few contestants.

117
00:05:47,700 --> 00:05:50,229
So these three have
decided to join forces.

118
00:05:50,420 --> 00:05:52,717
All right, now let's talk logistics here.

119
00:05:52,800 --> 00:05:55,137
First, each contestant
will introduce herself.

120
00:05:55,220 --> 00:05:57,637
The attire for that round
is everyday clothing.

121
00:05:57,720 --> 00:06:00,097
But we should still put
a lot of energy into it.

122
00:06:00,180 --> 00:06:01,660
Mm-hmm. Well, naturally.

123
00:06:02,020 --> 00:06:05,537
Next, we show off special skills,
but the assignment is twofold.

124
00:06:05,620 --> 00:06:08,517
We have to demonstrate our skill
and appeal at the same time,

125
00:06:08,600 --> 00:06:10,700
and we can wear whatever we like.

126
00:06:11,300 --> 00:06:12,220
Special skills?

127
00:06:12,640 --> 00:06:13,877
That's archery for me.

128
00:06:13,960 --> 00:06:17,313
And, um, I guess I could pick
up some really heavy stuff.

129
00:06:17,480 --> 00:06:19,774
I could show off some of my inventions.

130
00:06:21,020 --> 00:06:23,840
But what about... clothes?

131
00:06:24,800 --> 00:06:25,741
There's the rub.

132
00:06:27,020 --> 00:06:30,657
All I have besides this is my
pajamas and boring casual stuff.

133
00:06:30,740 --> 00:06:31,800
Oh, same here.

134
00:06:32,020 --> 00:06:35,020
Yeah, I've never given much
thought to what I wear.

135
00:06:35,140 --> 00:06:37,040
This is such a sad conversation.

136
00:06:37,300 --> 00:06:39,757
What if we just made a few
slight alterations to the

137
00:06:39,840 --> 00:06:42,477
clothes we're wearing now to
make them show a bit more skin?

138
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:44,900
Ooh, yeah, I like that idea.

139
00:06:45,440 --> 00:06:46,920
Please, get a grip.

140
00:06:47,580 --> 00:06:51,257
Do you think you can beat Shirley
when it comes to showing skin?

141
00:06:51,340 --> 00:06:52,560
I can't beat that!

142
00:06:53,340 --> 00:06:58,037
In my personal opinion, they have a shot
if they compete in terms of natural beauty.

143
00:06:58,120 --> 00:07:00,944
But I think it'd be best
not to expose too much.

144
00:07:02,100 --> 00:07:04,917
Well, there's a shop here
in town that sells fabric.

145
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:07,657
And I think there's still
time for me to make something.

146
00:07:07,740 --> 00:07:09,537
Shui, you can make clothes by hand?

147
00:07:09,620 --> 00:07:11,497
The kids at the orphanage
have always liked them,

148
00:07:11,580 --> 00:07:15,397
Finding quality children's clothing in the
dungeon can be a real pain in the neck.

149
00:07:15,480 --> 00:07:18,197
Then we just have to come
up with some good designs.

150
00:07:18,280 --> 00:07:20,737
But don't ask me, I don't
think I'd be good at that.

151
00:07:20,820 --> 00:07:23,817
Yeah, I have no idea how to
do any of that stuff either.

152
00:07:23,900 --> 00:07:25,257
I'm good at children's clothes,

153
00:07:25,340 --> 00:07:29,222
but I wouldn't know where to begin
with dressy outfits for adults.

154
00:07:31,780 --> 00:07:34,015
Boxo, why'd you suddenly change shape?

155
00:07:35,360 --> 00:07:36,340
What is that?

156
00:07:36,880 --> 00:07:39,597
There are some very pretty
pictures in these books.

157
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:42,033
They're wearing clothes I've never seen.

158
00:07:42,160 --> 00:07:43,920
This outfit's so cute!

159
00:07:44,500 --> 00:07:47,440
Oh, yeah, this sort of
thing could work. Uh-huh.

160
00:07:47,760 --> 00:07:49,466
Ooh, look, this is cute, too.

161
00:07:49,580 --> 00:07:51,997
Is this what they wear
in the world box-os from?

162
00:07:52,080 --> 00:07:53,100
Wow, amazing!

163
00:07:53,600 --> 00:07:54,894
Ooh, I like this look.

164
00:07:55,100 --> 00:07:56,137
This looks great!

165
00:07:56,220 --> 00:07:57,657
That would work on me.

166
00:07:57,740 --> 00:07:58,570
That's lovely.

167
00:07:58,660 --> 00:07:59,490
Ooh, I like this.

168
00:07:59,573 --> 00:08:02,517
I had a feeling they'd lose
themselves in this sort of thing.

169
00:08:02,600 --> 00:08:04,297
Oh, that one just screams cute.

170
00:08:04,380 --> 00:08:05,498
How about this one?

171
00:08:05,880 --> 00:08:06,840
Wow. Yeah.

172
00:08:07,860 --> 00:08:09,037
Wow, good work.

173
00:08:09,120 --> 00:08:10,944
Glad we have some kind of plan.

174
00:08:11,120 --> 00:08:14,057
I'll get going right away on our
wardrobe for the competition.

175
00:08:14,140 --> 00:08:14,970
Thanks, Shui.

176
00:08:15,053 --> 00:08:18,412
And we'll think up an idea for
your archery demonstration.

177
00:08:18,700 --> 00:08:22,517
We've been through a lot lately, so
I'm just glad they're having fun.

178
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:26,737
As for what kind of outfits they've settled
on, seems I'll find out on the day of.

179
00:08:26,820 --> 00:08:28,340
Hip, hip, hooray!

180
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:33,268
I'll have to see if I can come
up with some way to help, too.

181
00:08:33,460 --> 00:08:38,757
The day has finally come for the Dungeon
Goddess Grand Prix, or DGGP for short.

182
00:08:38,840 --> 00:08:41,397
Clear for Low Lake Stratum's
festivals are amazing!

183
00:08:41,480 --> 00:08:43,557
I've never had this much
fun in my whole family!

184
00:08:43,640 --> 00:08:44,857
Good morning, Radies!

185
00:08:44,940 --> 00:08:45,770
Oh, hi!

186
00:08:45,853 --> 00:08:46,683
Good morning, Shui!

187
00:08:46,766 --> 00:08:47,596
Hey!

188
00:08:47,679 --> 00:08:49,839
I got no sleep, but I managed
to finish the outfits.

189
00:08:49,940 --> 00:08:52,337
Shui must have been up all night sewing!

190
00:08:52,420 --> 00:08:53,340
You poor thing!

191
00:08:53,500 --> 00:08:57,217
But like we agreed, if any of the three
of us wins, we'll give the prize to you!

192
00:08:57,300 --> 00:08:58,130
Yeah.

193
00:08:58,213 --> 00:08:59,957
Truth be told, I don't see myself winning.

194
00:09:00,040 --> 00:09:02,217
But if I manage to pull
it off, it's yours.

195
00:09:02,300 --> 00:09:03,660
I appreciate it.

196
00:09:03,780 --> 00:09:07,020
Well, Boxo, make some
noise, okay? Psst! Eat you!

197
00:09:08,920 --> 00:09:09,940
Aw, crap!

198
00:09:10,280 --> 00:09:12,456
I can't even see the stage from here!

199
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:17,602
And it'd be too much to move using the
cardboard vending machine and balloon combo.

200
00:09:17,800 --> 00:09:20,900
Boxo, this is perfect
weather for a festival, eh?

201
00:09:21,180 --> 00:09:23,157
Oh, but you can't see crap from there.

202
00:09:23,240 --> 00:09:25,537
How about I move you somewhere
with better visibility?

203
00:09:25,620 --> 00:09:26,797
Does that sound good?

204
00:09:26,880 --> 00:09:28,400
Thank you very much!

205
00:09:28,620 --> 00:09:30,520
Director Bear coming in clutch.

206
00:09:33,740 --> 00:09:35,780
Oh, you gotta be kidding me.

207
00:09:36,080 --> 00:09:37,800
Oh, Boxo's here too!

208
00:09:38,360 --> 00:09:40,237
I've sure been looking forward to today.

209
00:09:40,320 --> 00:09:41,438
Too much, actually.

210
00:09:41,680 --> 00:09:44,137
In fact, I've got dark
circles under my eyes.

211
00:09:44,220 --> 00:09:47,640
I see Director Dark is as
talkative as ever, isn't he?

212
00:09:47,860 --> 00:09:51,677
Speaking of talkative, you'll never
believe what happened to me yesterday.

213
00:09:51,760 --> 00:09:54,357
We've been working feverishly
to learn clear flow strategy.

214
00:09:54,440 --> 00:09:57,777
Director Dark on my left,
Director Labyrinth on my right.

215
00:09:57,860 --> 00:09:59,820
Worst surround sound ever.

216
00:10:00,080 --> 00:10:02,977
Would you two chatterboxes
mind giving it a rest, please?

217
00:10:03,060 --> 00:10:04,413
We'll be starting soon.

218
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:07,277
Your judges and I want you both
to take that rule seriously.

219
00:10:07,360 --> 00:10:08,190
Sorry.

220
00:10:08,273 --> 00:10:09,317
Heard and understood.

221
00:10:09,400 --> 00:10:10,580
I hear you, big guy.

222
00:10:10,760 --> 00:10:12,297
I promise to give it my all.

223
00:10:12,380 --> 00:10:13,660
Whew. Thank goodness.

224
00:10:14,100 --> 00:10:16,300
But wait, what am I doing here?

225
00:10:16,440 --> 00:10:19,558
I figured I would invite
you to be a judge too, Boxo.

226
00:10:19,860 --> 00:10:22,937
Director Origin was originally
supposed to be on the panel,

227
00:10:23,020 --> 00:10:25,800
but she had to back out
for personal reasons.

228
00:10:26,040 --> 00:10:28,280
And so Boxo got appointed instead?

229
00:10:28,680 --> 00:10:32,417
I trust you'll be fair about it
even with your friends competing.

230
00:10:32,500 --> 00:10:37,020
I'm happy to know he has confidence
in me, but now I have to be a judge?

231
00:10:37,860 --> 00:10:39,820
That's a big responsibility.

232
00:10:41,460 --> 00:10:42,480
Hello, everyone.

233
00:10:42,740 --> 00:10:44,977
We appreciate you being
such a patient crowd.

234
00:10:45,060 --> 00:10:45,980
And now,

235
00:10:46,180 --> 00:10:50,477
the first installment of the Clear Flow
Lake Stratum Dungeon Goddess Grand Prix.

236
00:10:50,560 --> 00:10:52,440
Who's the best girl, folks?

237
00:10:52,780 --> 00:10:55,486
Now, let's go ahead and
meet our participants.

238
00:10:55,680 --> 00:11:00,600
First up, to start us off right,
it's Akui from the Exchange House.

239
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:03,647
The only thing I'm after
is that grand prize.

240
00:11:04,020 --> 00:11:06,377
Now, as you all know, nothing's
better than free stuff.

241
00:11:06,460 --> 00:11:09,166
No strings attached is
the best deal there is.

242
00:11:10,820 --> 00:11:13,737
Next is Thea, this lovely
lady from the item shop.

243
00:11:13,820 --> 00:11:17,217
It turns out she was secretly very
popular among our male hunters.

244
00:11:17,300 --> 00:11:19,797
But I hear there's been
lots of weeping and moaning

245
00:11:19,880 --> 00:11:22,477
ever since she started
going out with Karyos.

246
00:11:22,560 --> 00:11:25,100
Um, I promise to do the very best I can.

247
00:11:26,040 --> 00:11:27,160
She's so cute!

248
00:11:29,020 --> 00:11:31,373
Moving along, from the band of gluttons,

249
00:11:31,600 --> 00:11:33,857
she's quick on her paws
and has a big appetite.

250
00:11:33,940 --> 00:11:34,770
Here's Suco!

251
00:11:34,853 --> 00:11:38,837
I just want to win and get all the
fried chicken that a girl could want!

252
00:11:38,920 --> 00:11:40,520
You got this!

253
00:11:41,300 --> 00:11:42,200
Number four!

254
00:11:42,580 --> 00:11:45,517
She just entered yesterday,
which was a last-minute surprise.

255
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:46,835
It's Director Origin!

256
00:11:50,800 --> 00:11:53,060
You look lovely, Director Origin!

257
00:11:53,740 --> 00:11:55,034
Don't forget to smile!

258
00:11:55,240 --> 00:11:56,534
I know, you can do it!

259
00:11:57,840 --> 00:11:59,980
Whoa, it looks the tail scaring!

260
00:12:00,200 --> 00:12:02,237
I don't know what you
expected considering she only

261
00:12:02,320 --> 00:12:05,117
entered the competition because
of your relentless bullying.

262
00:12:05,200 --> 00:12:07,577
I have no idea what you're talking about.

263
00:12:07,660 --> 00:12:11,131
Oh, so that's why they needed
me to step in and be a judge.

264
00:12:13,600 --> 00:12:16,776
This fine stratum is taking
good care of my residents.

265
00:12:16,940 --> 00:12:21,528
To show my gratitude, I thought I'd enter
the competition and liven things up.

266
00:12:23,060 --> 00:12:23,890
Direction!

267
00:12:23,973 --> 00:12:24,803
Direction!

268
00:12:24,886 --> 00:12:25,716
Direction!

269
00:12:25,799 --> 00:12:26,687
And now, our fifth entrance.

270
00:12:27,020 --> 00:12:29,597
She's also donated the
prize for this Grand Prix.

271
00:12:29,680 --> 00:12:31,897
It's our very own girl boss, Stuari.

272
00:12:31,980 --> 00:12:34,804
I'm here today to kick
butt and win first place.

273
00:12:35,020 --> 00:12:36,902
Let's make this a great contest.

274
00:12:39,120 --> 00:12:42,300
Number six, she's yet
another adorable entrant.

275
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:44,200
It's Kiku Yu.

276
00:12:46,820 --> 00:12:48,060
I'll do my best.

277
00:12:48,360 --> 00:12:53,007
Also, don't forget about all the fresh
vegetables I've got for sale over there.

278
00:12:54,980 --> 00:12:58,098
All right, does everyone
have a favorite girl so far?

279
00:12:58,260 --> 00:13:01,797
Well, hold your horses, because there
are still some you've yet to see.

280
00:13:01,880 --> 00:13:06,060
Number seven, it's our hunter with
a stomach of steel, Shoo-Wing!

281
00:13:06,640 --> 00:13:10,052
When I win, I'm gonna eat and
eat and eat until I explode!

282
00:13:10,240 --> 00:13:11,917
We're down to the final three.

283
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:14,765
I wonder, who could our
next challenger be now?

284
00:13:15,080 --> 00:13:18,256
Munami's starting to sound
like this is a prize fight!

285
00:13:18,380 --> 00:13:21,500
Our brilliant magic
item engineer, Hulamain!

286
00:13:23,160 --> 00:13:24,877
Hey, girl, you feeling pumped?

287
00:13:24,960 --> 00:13:26,980
I am here, and that's enough.

288
00:13:27,260 --> 00:13:31,460
Now, for our penultimate powerhouse,
This girl's a favorite to win!

289
00:13:31,740 --> 00:13:34,360
Nothing slows down this super strong lady!

290
00:13:34,680 --> 00:13:36,420
It's Llamas the Hunter!

291
00:13:38,840 --> 00:13:39,670
Boxo!

292
00:13:39,900 --> 00:13:41,900
I promise to give it my best shot!

293
00:13:43,100 --> 00:13:43,930
Huh?

294
00:13:44,120 --> 00:13:46,137
I didn't know Llamas was so popular.

295
00:13:46,220 --> 00:13:48,420
But the crowd is going crazy for her!

296
00:13:48,860 --> 00:13:52,040
And at last, it's time
for our final contestant!

297
00:13:52,440 --> 00:13:55,264
Word on the street is
she's the favorite to win!

298
00:13:55,640 --> 00:13:58,720
It's the moment you've
all been waiting for!

299
00:14:00,840 --> 00:14:02,980
Give it up for Shirley!

300
00:14:05,120 --> 00:14:07,600
Everyone, deep breath. Ready?

301
00:14:07,980 --> 00:14:09,440
Now scream for me!

302
00:14:15,400 --> 00:14:16,929
What's with this cheering?

303
00:14:17,080 --> 00:14:18,357
It's on another level.

304
00:14:18,440 --> 00:14:21,337
Will we be able to make up the
difference in later events?

305
00:14:21,420 --> 00:14:25,097
Okay, ladies and gentlemen, let's
have another big round of applause!

306
00:14:25,180 --> 00:14:27,197
Sure enough, Shirley's
the favorite to win.

307
00:14:27,280 --> 00:14:30,357
Now we'll take a quick break
so the ladies can get changed.

308
00:14:30,440 --> 00:14:33,937
But don't go far, because the special
skill demonstrations are up next.

309
00:14:34,020 --> 00:14:36,337
Boxo, we need you for just a few seconds.

310
00:14:36,420 --> 00:14:38,479
Sorry, it won't take long, promise.

311
00:14:38,700 --> 00:14:40,229
What the heck is going on?

312
00:14:41,560 --> 00:14:42,960
We probably don't...

313
00:14:43,520 --> 00:14:46,108
No, we don't stand a
chance against Shirley,

314
00:14:46,260 --> 00:14:48,717
but there's nothing that we can
do about it all by ourselves.

315
00:14:48,800 --> 00:14:51,397
Look, we know that this is
asking you for a great deal,

316
00:14:51,480 --> 00:14:55,237
but do you carry any products
that could make us more appealing?

317
00:14:55,320 --> 00:14:56,320
Anything, please.

318
00:14:57,700 --> 00:14:59,717
It's not like there are no options,

319
00:14:59,800 --> 00:15:02,897
but we don't have time to do
this for all three of them.

320
00:15:02,980 --> 00:15:06,540
I have a plan, but not enough.

321
00:15:06,840 --> 00:15:09,617
You have an idea, but there's
not enough of something?

322
00:15:09,700 --> 00:15:11,120
Like tools? Too bad.

323
00:15:11,320 --> 00:15:12,917
Then is there not enough time?

324
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:13,830
Hello there.

325
00:15:14,120 --> 00:15:17,697
Does that mean there's not enough time to
apply whatever it is to all three of us?

326
00:15:17,780 --> 00:15:18,610
Hello there.

327
00:15:19,100 --> 00:15:21,857
If that's it, then you
two should do it, not me.

328
00:15:21,940 --> 00:15:25,477
After all, if either of you wins it,
I will still get the prize regardless.

329
00:15:25,560 --> 00:15:26,737
Um, Shui, are you sure?

330
00:15:26,820 --> 00:15:28,000
Of course I am.

331
00:15:28,100 --> 00:15:30,977
You have your heart set on taking
first place way more than I do.

332
00:15:31,060 --> 00:15:33,300
Mm-hmm. It's a deal. Thanks, Chewie.

333
00:15:33,920 --> 00:15:36,677
Loxo, please, I'll do
anything to win anything!

334
00:15:36,760 --> 00:15:40,140
I'm not confident, to be
honest, but I'll do what I can.

335
00:15:41,760 --> 00:15:42,720
Form change!

336
00:15:43,960 --> 00:15:45,840
A cosmetics vending machine!

337
00:15:46,680 --> 00:15:48,020
What is this thing?

338
00:15:48,500 --> 00:15:50,757
Ever since the three of
them decided to enter,

339
00:15:50,840 --> 00:15:54,377
I have been reading fashion
magazines at night and practicing my

340
00:15:54,460 --> 00:15:57,577
makeup skills to figure out what
looks people will like the best.

341
00:15:57,660 --> 00:15:58,860
But make no mistake,

342
00:15:59,100 --> 00:16:02,297
I bought all this stuff in the
name of my vending machine fandom.

343
00:16:02,380 --> 00:16:06,600
Now, it's time to make these
two shine with my new skills.

344
00:16:09,700 --> 00:16:11,800
Voxo's new vending machine power!

345
00:16:13,940 --> 00:16:14,770
Makeup!

346
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:22,941
Voxo's new vending machine power!

347
00:16:25,760 --> 00:16:26,590
Makeup!

348
00:16:34,540 --> 00:16:35,370
Bobso!

349
00:16:36,240 --> 00:16:39,017
Ladies and gentlemen, thanks
for your patience today!

350
00:16:39,100 --> 00:16:41,517
But it's time for the
special skills demonstration.

351
00:16:41,600 --> 00:16:43,620
First up, number one, Akkui!

352
00:16:43,940 --> 00:16:45,116
Take it away, girly!

353
00:16:45,660 --> 00:16:48,601
High-speed coin sorting,
gold, silver, and copper.

354
00:16:50,500 --> 00:16:53,382
Gold, copper, silver,
silver, copper, gold, gold!

355
00:16:54,320 --> 00:16:57,400
Secret Rite, mixing a high mega potion!

356
00:16:57,800 --> 00:16:58,700
Woo-hoo!

357
00:16:59,520 --> 00:17:00,620
Speed eating!

358
00:17:00,940 --> 00:17:02,116
Thanks for the food!

359
00:17:02,240 --> 00:17:03,120
Way to go!

360
00:17:12,180 --> 00:17:14,340
Here we go, boys!

361
00:17:23,120 --> 00:17:26,097
So I and Kiko, you didn't
really do anything themselves.

362
00:17:26,180 --> 00:17:27,937
Next, it's Shui's turn, finally.

363
00:17:28,020 --> 00:17:31,549
How's she gonna dress, and what
kind of archery will she do?

364
00:17:31,700 --> 00:17:32,530
Huh?

365
00:17:32,613 --> 00:17:34,280
She's wearing a gym outfit?

366
00:17:34,520 --> 00:17:36,537
That would've been my very last guess.

367
00:17:36,620 --> 00:17:38,877
That outfit looks easy to move around in.

368
00:17:38,960 --> 00:17:41,997
I've never seen that outfit before,
but it kinda seems just right.

369
00:17:42,080 --> 00:17:43,857
Yes, it's hard to put my paw on it,

370
00:17:43,940 --> 00:17:47,234
but something about that getup
really does draw the eye.

371
00:17:53,640 --> 00:17:56,758
I think this might be the
best crowd response so far.

372
00:17:56,980 --> 00:17:58,140
Now, moving on.

373
00:17:58,400 --> 00:18:01,377
Pulumi and Llamas are appearing
as a team of two today.

374
00:18:01,460 --> 00:18:03,284
Show us what you can do, girls.

375
00:18:10,160 --> 00:18:10,990
Pulumi,

376
00:18:11,073 --> 00:18:12,737
I never thought you'd take this approach,

377
00:18:12,820 --> 00:18:15,585
and I'm surprised by how
well it works for you.

378
00:18:16,860 --> 00:18:19,017
Llamas pulled off the blazer look.

379
00:18:19,100 --> 00:18:23,140
This is, this is undeniably super cute.

380
00:18:23,820 --> 00:18:27,580
It seems Hulemy is going to
unveil her new magic item.

381
00:18:27,780 --> 00:18:29,015
Let's see what it is.

382
00:18:31,180 --> 00:18:32,840
Okay, it's ready.

383
00:18:33,640 --> 00:18:34,470
Activate.

384
00:18:44,360 --> 00:18:45,380
Woo-hoo!

385
00:18:45,660 --> 00:18:46,660
Now we lift!

386
00:18:49,100 --> 00:18:49,930
No, don't!

387
00:18:54,220 --> 00:18:55,050
Great.

388
00:18:56,760 --> 00:18:58,700
Oh, no, no! I'm coming!

389
00:19:00,680 --> 00:19:03,020
They got the crowd going the most.

390
00:19:03,200 --> 00:19:06,517
And I'd like to think that the
outfits and makeup helped too.

391
00:19:06,600 --> 00:19:10,129
Now the moment you've all been
waiting for, our final entry.

392
00:19:14,980 --> 00:19:17,300
Mom, do I really have to read this?

393
00:19:19,100 --> 00:19:20,747
I beg your pardon, everyone.

394
00:19:20,980 --> 00:19:24,057
I do apologize, but...

395
00:19:24,140 --> 00:19:29,220
Shirley has fallen ill and we'll
have to withdraw from the running!

396
00:19:31,480 --> 00:19:32,960
No, what happened?

397
00:19:33,280 --> 00:19:34,339
I hope she's okay.

398
00:19:34,680 --> 00:19:37,380
I never imagined Shirley would drop out.

399
00:19:37,740 --> 00:19:40,269
Now there's really no
telling who will win.

400
00:19:42,800 --> 00:19:45,153
I guess we can only wait for the result.

401
00:19:45,400 --> 00:19:47,037
I can't wait to see who wins.

402
00:19:47,120 --> 00:19:48,597
It's just all so exciting.

403
00:19:48,680 --> 00:19:49,540
Huh? Shirley?

404
00:19:49,860 --> 00:19:51,180
Oh, too bad.

405
00:19:52,300 --> 00:19:54,340
Yes, but I am better now.

406
00:19:54,720 --> 00:19:57,838
It is too bad that I had to
withdraw partway through.

407
00:19:58,040 --> 00:19:58,870
Uh-huh.

408
00:19:58,953 --> 00:19:59,997
Thank you for the drink.

409
00:20:00,080 --> 00:20:03,180
It's odd, but she seems
healthy enough to me.

410
00:20:04,220 --> 00:20:05,257
What if...

411
00:20:05,340 --> 00:20:07,140
I'll hold a little arm.

412
00:20:08,000 --> 00:20:09,320
You be the judge.

413
00:20:10,480 --> 00:20:11,310
Interesting.

414
00:20:11,520 --> 00:20:12,991
This is just speculation.

415
00:20:13,260 --> 00:20:15,957
But maybe Shirley only ever
said she was going to be

416
00:20:16,040 --> 00:20:19,040
in the contest to get people
more excited about it.

417
00:20:19,340 --> 00:20:20,900
Thank you very much.

418
00:20:21,800 --> 00:20:22,840
Don't mention it.

419
00:20:23,340 --> 00:20:25,222
Ah, voting has officially ended.

420
00:20:25,360 --> 00:20:27,772
All we can do now is wait for the result.

421
00:20:28,160 --> 00:20:30,177
Heavy doesn't care about
anything but shoes,

422
00:20:30,260 --> 00:20:33,357
so I wonder if he really had
any interest in this at all.

423
00:20:33,440 --> 00:20:35,040
Proveeked first place.

424
00:20:35,700 --> 00:20:36,660
Well, let's see.

425
00:20:37,440 --> 00:20:38,270
Personally,

426
00:20:38,353 --> 00:20:40,257
I think Director Origins'
bright red boots are

427
00:20:40,340 --> 00:20:44,820
stunning enough to win first place
on their own. Too bad! It's true.

428
00:20:45,080 --> 00:20:46,157
Heavy never wavers.

429
00:20:46,240 --> 00:20:49,797
Ladies and gents, once again,
thank you for being so patient.

430
00:20:49,880 --> 00:20:52,397
But it is finally time
to announce the winner.

431
00:20:52,480 --> 00:20:54,000
Oh, here it comes.

432
00:20:55,300 --> 00:20:58,320
Now, let's find out who our champion is.

433
00:21:01,600 --> 00:21:06,257
The honorable winner of the Clear Flow Lake
Stratum Dungeon Goddess Grand Prix is...

434
00:21:06,340 --> 00:21:07,340
Unvelope, please.

435
00:21:07,820 --> 00:21:10,757
She's perky, but don't forget
her super strength, folks.

436
00:21:10,840 --> 00:21:11,760
It's Lamas!

437
00:21:12,680 --> 00:21:14,520
You did it, Lamas!

438
00:21:18,340 --> 00:21:20,940
I really did it, Boxxo!

439
00:21:22,100 --> 00:21:25,960
And now we present the
champion, Lamas, with her prize.

440
00:21:26,360 --> 00:21:30,240
Lamas, you win 50 meal tickets
from your favorite guy, Boxxo!

441
00:21:30,580 --> 00:21:34,698
And this totally gorgeous magic item
courtesy of Suorries Corporation.

442
00:21:36,540 --> 00:21:38,460
Those boots, finally.

443
00:21:40,900 --> 00:21:42,980
I finally found them.

444
00:21:43,500 --> 00:21:44,940
What does he mean?

445
00:21:45,500 --> 00:21:47,794
Is there something up with those boots?

446
00:21:52,820 --> 00:21:53,650
Boxxo!

447
00:21:53,733 --> 00:21:55,280
I won first place!

448
00:21:55,380 --> 00:21:57,600
And I'm going to eat time! Pass out!

449
00:21:58,200 --> 00:21:59,141
Congratulations!

450
00:21:59,420 --> 00:22:03,067
But something's come up that we
should do before we celebrate.

451
00:22:03,340 --> 00:22:05,340
Why, how do you do, Miss Sawari?

452
00:22:05,600 --> 00:22:06,537
My name's Heavy.

453
00:22:06,620 --> 00:22:07,697
It's nice to meet you.

454
00:22:07,780 --> 00:22:10,537
I accompany Boxxo in his
travels hunting monsters

455
00:22:10,620 --> 00:22:12,897
and exploring the dungeon with the others.

456
00:22:12,980 --> 00:22:15,177
Thank you for your courtesy and decorum.

457
00:22:15,260 --> 00:22:17,319
My name's Sawari, nice to meet you.

458
00:22:17,460 --> 00:22:21,048
With all that out of the way,
tell me, what may I do for you?

459
00:22:21,320 --> 00:22:25,849
Well, I'd like to ask about the boots
you provided for the first place prize.

460
00:22:26,000 --> 00:22:28,117
Lamas, would you please show them to us?

461
00:22:28,200 --> 00:22:29,141
Of course, here.

462
00:22:30,220 --> 00:22:32,700
The shape, size, quality.

463
00:22:33,180 --> 00:22:35,480
Sure enough, there can be no mistake.

464
00:22:36,040 --> 00:22:39,746
Is my suspicion correct that
these are the untiring god's feet?

465
00:22:39,980 --> 00:22:42,257
My, you're a real footwear connoisseur.

466
00:22:42,340 --> 00:22:44,537
They are one of the
masterpieces of Logdium,

467
00:22:44,620 --> 00:22:47,817
a master craftsman renowned
for their shoemaking skills.

468
00:22:47,900 --> 00:22:49,460
Yes, just as I thought.

469
00:22:49,740 --> 00:22:54,260
If I may, I should like to inquire
where you obtained these boots.

470
00:22:54,620 --> 00:22:57,100
Sure, we'd be happy to share. Yes, ma 'am.

471
00:22:57,320 --> 00:22:59,557
Your father said that he
procured those boots during

472
00:22:59,640 --> 00:23:01,997
one of his trips to the
Scorching Sand Stratum.

473
00:23:02,080 --> 00:23:06,315
I recall him being rather elated, as
they were a considerably rare find.

474
00:23:06,840 --> 00:23:07,840
Ah, I see.

475
00:23:08,120 --> 00:23:10,238
The Scorching Sand Stratum, you say.

476
00:23:10,740 --> 00:23:12,858
Thank you very much for your answer.

477
00:23:13,660 --> 00:23:15,420
Are you all right?

478
00:23:21,660 --> 00:23:25,500
I sold lots of alcohol at last
night's Grand Prix wrap party.

479
00:23:25,880 --> 00:23:28,645
Soup with basket clams
will be in demand today.

480
00:23:29,640 --> 00:23:30,980
Boxo! It's Heavy!

481
00:23:31,280 --> 00:23:32,809
Have you seen Heavy today?

482
00:23:32,980 --> 00:23:35,317
Shui's desperate cries seemed
to signal that our brief

483
00:23:35,400 --> 00:23:38,640
time of fun and leisure
had come to an abrupt end.
